{
  "$comment": [
    "The OpenAPM Registry HTTP API conformance cases ShelfKit's registries pass: `shelfkit serve` and the hosted Worker.",
    "Read by crates/registry/src/conformance.rs (Rust) and packages/engine/src/conformance.ts (TypeScript); the format is documented in the Rust module.",
    "Each scenario starts from an empty registry serving one shelf under `owner`. Archives are generated by `conformance::archives()`; a test keeps the files and digests in step."
  ],
